MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Addresses review: the graph contract now models provider sources explicitly
instead of silently coercing them to 'memory'.

- types/hermes.ts: StarmapNode.memorySource / StarmapMemoryCard.source widen
  from 'memory' | 'profile' to string; new optional sessionId (provenance)
  and origin fields. sources.ts: isProviderSource() classifier — single
  definition shared by UI + codec
- node-context-menu: provider-backed nodes are read-only — Edit/Delete
  replaced with an explanatory note (i18n en/zh)
- node-sessions-dialog (double-click): originating session(s) via direct
  provenance lookup with content-search fallback; provider nodes can read
  the raw source corpus and recreate it as a Hermes session
- search sidebar: fuzzy search over nodes incl. provider sources
- star-map: wire the above through canvas double-click + context menu
